*~
.DS_Store

# Project local
*.log
*.tmp

# vibe-ic#361, producer side. The `*.log` rule above is right for build noise
# and wrong for EVIDENCE: a sign-off report that cites `foo.log` as its proof
# could never ship that proof, because the ignore rule silently dropped it.
# The gate added for #361 blocks a NEW dangling citation; this is the other
# half — logs that live beside the reports they prove are deliverables. Adds
# in this repo are always explicit paths, so nothing is swept in by this.
!benchmark-data/**/reports/**/*.log
.env
.env.local

# Private commercial-PDK config (NDA). Resolved at runtime by
# plugins/vibe-ic/programs/_commercial_pdk.py from $VIBEIC_PRIVATE_CONFIG or
# ~/.config/vibeic/commercial_pdk.json (both OUTSIDE the repo by default). This
# defensively ignores any repo-local copy so the private SKU never gets tracked.
**/commercial_pdk.json
.config/vibeic/

# EDA tool outputs (large, regeneratable)
*.gds
*.def
*.lef.tmp
*.sof
*.pof
*.jou
*.rda
work/
runs/

# Quartus local
db/
incremental_db/
output_files/
greybox_tmp/

# OS
Thumbs.db

# wave76 skill-md audit tool output (generated each test run)
docs/reports/

# Simulation artifacts
*.vcd
*.fst
*.ghw
*.shm

# KLayout local view config
.klayout_view/

# Test-generated synthetic fixtures (rebuilt by build_synthetic_benchmark_phase1)
**/tests/fixtures/synthetic_benchmark_phase1/
# Plugin audit reports (generated by plugin_full_audit.py)
vibe-ic-marketplace/plugins/vibe-ic/reports/

# Verilator / sim build artifacts (regeneratable)
**/obj_dir/
*.gch
*.vvp
simv

# Scratch Workflow/template orchestration scripts (root-level _*.js) — session
# scratch, never committed (ORGANIC #720). Anchored to root so it does NOT match
# tracked source like vibe-ic-marketplace/.../mcp-eda/src/devices/_registry.js.
/_*.js
history.md

# Local benchmark RUN PRODUCTS are never committed wholesale — only a curated,
# NDA-scrubbed results-only subset is (each shipped run dir carries its own
# .gitignore whitelisting just its RESULT.md + clean report JSONs). A raw local
# run dir can carry the commercial-PDK identifier in its own NAME, so leaving
# these untracked-but-not-ignored is one `git add -A` away from re-leaking what
# the 2026-07-19/20 history rewrite removed. Ignore raw run dirs by default;
# a curated run is added explicitly with `git add <path>` (never -A).
benchmark-data/ic/*/clean_run_*/
!benchmark-data/ic/*/clean_run_*/.gitignore
!benchmark-data/ic/*/clean_run_*/RESULT.md
!benchmark-data/ic/*/clean_run_*/reports/
# Vendored upstream benchmark datasets — large, and not ours to redistribute.
benchmark-data/datasets/

# --- benchmark-data 收斂證據的 physical 產物（2026-07-25）---
# 小 cell 的 GDS/DEF/SPEF 只有 KB-MB（spm GDS 最大 1.2MB），該進 git 讓交付包可從
# netlist 重建到 GDS。大 die 的大檔（>50MB）由 benchmark_evidence_structure_check 的
# size-guard 擋、改走 git-lfs / GitHub Release（sha256 存 MANIFEST）。
!benchmark-data/ic/**/*.gds
!benchmark-data/ic/**/*.def
